From 7b51c60177b7155939e1d58d896598a563623ce8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wren <wren@noodle.example>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 10:05:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Film hidden noodlets frame by frame

A hidden page gets no animation frames from WebKit, so filming it in
real time froze the movie. Recording now drives its own clock and asks
the page for one frame at a time instead.
